{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選舉委員會界別分組選舉結果陸續公布，鄉議局27名當選人分別是鄧善恒、林國昌、韋國洪、温揚堅、黃漢權、莫錦貴、邱榮光、李冠洪、李國鳳、林偉強、邱錦平、黃文漢、林奕權、陳崇業、陳志榮、何紹基、鄧志強、鄧賀年、温悅球、吳文傑、周雪茵、陳月明、李耀斌、陶桂英、劉啟康、余漢坤、黃秋萍。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T13:23:52.169675+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T12:53:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T13:17:26.887700+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T13:17:26.887700+00:00","content_hash":"45417d1f9d53ea1b52230e53e1ddc89d5c7abaa98eb2e79a6d9e7b851bff8900","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}